  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I turn tails and quickly head back home. During all this
      time, the statuette still radiates a faint heat in my pocket, so tenuous that
      I might just be imagining it.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: It's probably whatever rock this thing is made of. It's
      not uncomfortable or anything. It's... Quite soothing, actually.
    TextAlignment: 257
